Project Development Phase

The Project Development Phase is the stage where the planned design and requirements are converted into a working project.

Main Points:

Write Code – Developers create the software using suitable programming languages.
Build Features – Develop important functions according to the requirements.
Integrate Components – Connect the frontend, backend, database, and other services.
Test During Development – Check each feature and fix errors or bugs.
Create Working Product – Combine all components to produce a functional project.
